{'symbol': 'DLR', 'date': '2022-06-09 09:07:00', 'title': 'FIBERSENSE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ADDS INTERNATIONAL IT INFRASTRUCTURE EXPERIENCE WITH CHRIS SHARP JOINING AS CO-CHAIR', 'text': 'BOULDER, COLO. , JUNE 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RAPIDLY EXPANDING INFRASTRUCTURE SENSING AND MONITORING COMPANY, FIBER SENSE LIMITED (FIBERSENSE), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF CHRIS\xa0SHARP, DIGITAL REALTY (NYSE: DLR) CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER (CTO),\xa0AS A NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.'}